WEBVTT

00:00:00.278 --> 00:00:03.589
Took money out of the drawer? <b>Record it</b>

00:00:03.643 --> 00:00:05.912
Type how much you took

00:00:05.955 --> 00:00:10.387
And what for: a payment, a purchase, the water jug

00:00:10.436 --> 00:00:13.988
Record it, and the cash count already takes it into account

00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:20.280
In <b>Caja</b> (cash) you see every expense: when, who and why
